# The index stores every text file with LF, but a Windows/WSL checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF on the way out. That breaks shell
# scripts outright (`/bin/bash^M: bad interpreter`) and makes `.env` files
# unsourceable, so pin the working tree to LF regardless of the machine's git
# config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
